    "phase9": "Capture the exact presented swapchain image at the Wine win32u Present boundary and copy it into the exported PocketPC image resource.",
    "phase10": "Present the synchronized resource in Android and require a host-visible frame.",
    "phase11": "Run D3D11 Present end-to-end and only then enable a controlled Roblox attempt.",
